window.products.push({"id":504029,"name":"Washcloths Set - 12\" x 12\" 100% Cotton Navy Blue Face Towels Soft and High Absorbent Bathroom Towel, Kitchen Towel, and Gym Towel ,10 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YVcL5EhrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand Introduction We are an enterprise focusing on making high-quality towels, aiming to develop and produce the best luxury towels and provide customers with the best shopping experience. As a growing company, we are willing to listen to any suggestions from you, and continue to improve, to provide you with better products and services. Absorbency Our towels are made of 100% cotton. High-quality cotton grows under sufficient light conditions to produce high-grade cotton with good internal quality. The combed cotton yarn produced by high-quality cotton through the production process, the number of loops on the surface of the towel, and the length of the loops all affect the water absorption. Softness The cotton yarn spun with good quality cotton fiber is of good quality and gives a soft feeling. The surface of the towel has long loops and the loop part is spirally processed during the bleaching and dyeing process. The towel is thicker, has good water absorption, soft feel, high density, and washing resistance. Fade-Resistant Color Printing and dyeing with reactive dyes, uniform dyeing, resistance to fine abrasion, not easy to fade. Easy Care 1.Pure cotton products cannot avoid the phenomenon of shed hair, which belongs to cotton fiber. Before starting to use the towel, it is recommended to wash the towel first. The subsequent washing will still shed but it will be lighter. After washing with water for about 3-5 times, the attached fluff will basically not shed.2.Wash towels separately from all other items of clothing as it will decrease the transfer of towel lint to other clothing.Please wash the dark colored towels separately.3.Do not use fabric softeners or bleaching agents, as they will damage the fabric and shorten the life and bulkiness of the towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YVcL5EhrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haitzu","source_asin":"B08P4WQK5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P4WQK5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P4WQK5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
