window.products.push({"id":504059,"name":"Infinity Lifestyle - Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, with With Long Lasting Ceramic Grinder Mechanism. Ceramic Grinder,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eqBSmV5FL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Looking for a sleek, efficient, and high-quality salt and pepper grinder mill then look no further! This dual purpose salt and pepper grinder will provide you with the option to have both coarse ground salt and pepper in one convenient device: Durable and easy-to-use stainless steel grinder which you can enjoy using for years. Don't want multiple grinders and shakers cluttering up your dinner table or counter? BUY THIS UNIT. More Flavor and Great Tasting Meals with One Twist. Fits in your hand comfortably and has an easy to operate grinding mechanism that will also look great at your dinner table or on the kitchen counter. If you are looking to add more style to your dining table and more flavor to your food, this Salt and Pepper Grinder Set is exactly what you need. Built for more flavor and fewer turns, this Salt and Pepper Mill features a ceramic mechanism for smooth operation, finesse and quality. Modern, stylish design with stainless steel accents and high-quality clear, BPA-free, acrylic body that lets you know when to refill Dual chambers for 2 in 1 capability. Top and bottom caps keeps excessive mess contained and keeps out dust and contaminants. Very easy to refill and clean Clear product chamber for easy product identification. Smooth operation with many grades of grinding thanks to high-performing ceramic grinding mechanism Complete Satisfaction for Our Customers We give our customer satisfaction utmost importance and if you are not 100% satisfied with your purchase and dissatisfied with our Pepper Grinder, we will refund your money. If you love food and really want to enjoy the bold and savory flavors of fresh ground pepper and salt without having to keep up with multiple shakers and grinders, then you will love our dual purpose salt and pepper grinder! Also makes a great gift for friends and family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eqBSmV5FL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Infinity Lifestyle","source_asin":"B01JJ1E6F0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JJ1E6F0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JJ1E6F0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
