window.products.push({"id":504075,"name":"Personalized Beach Ornaments 2022 – Polyresin Crab Beach Couple Christmas Ornament – Unique Travel Ornaments – Summer Ornaments for Christmas Tree – B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qbpkIcM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Beach Themed Christmas Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our beach ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of crab couple. This Christmas, remember your great summer adventures and bring the taste of the sea to your 2022 Holiday decor with these special beach Christmas tree ornaments! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized crab ornaments for Christmas tree often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every beach Christmas decor 2022 is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND beach travel Christmas ornament you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – Cherish your favorite memories and commemorate those incredible vacations and special moments spent with your loved ones that you want to remember most. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your unique Christmas vacation ornaments and beach party decorations will make your Christmas tree feel extra special and unique to your family home. Perfect gifts for the frequent travelers and beach lovers in your life! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our Christmas beach ornaments 2022 make great addition to your beach themed ornament set, personalized beach gifts and mini beach decorations for home to cherish every Holiday season. Your beach Xmas ornaments will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! The perfect beach lover gifts and Christmas vacation gifts to create loving and lasting memories that will surely be cherished forever! Happy Beach Lovers – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful beach, sea, coastal and ocean Christmas ornaments for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your beach theme Christmas decorations, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qbpkIcM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B09NTKG7F9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504075","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NTKG7F9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NTKG7F9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
