window.products.push({"id":504089,"name":"Can Opener,3 in 1 Manual Can Openers,Food-safe Stainless Steel Smooth Edge Sharp Cutting easy operation with Ergonomic Grips for seniors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6175JAusfqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🍓No need for heavy, cumbersome and expensive electric can openers. The soft handle, effortless design and the smooth operationmake it suitable for kids, adults, seniors and anyone with weak hand strength. 🍓Why choose our manual can opener? 💎Our Multifunction manual can opener is made of food grade 18/10 steel materials.The best kitchen tools!💎Opener manual side cutting mechanism will provide smooth edges for the can opener, ensuring that your hands are very safe. 💎An ergonomic, non-slip handle gives you extra strength to cut the lid with long, sharp wheels. The large knob ensures easy rotation.💎Multi-function can opener for all sizes of cans,be used on tin can, oil can, milk can, cat dog food can, metal can, aluminum can, beer can, small can, large can, round Can, square can etc.It is a perfect choice for home, restaurants, camping, outdoor picnics and so on. 💎Ergonomically Designed easy grip handle, ideal for seniors or users with joint issues.💎Easy to Store with two hanging hole. corrosion resistant and easy to clean.With a portable bottle opener, you can open a beer bottle anytime, anywhere. 🍓How to use ? 💎Open handles until the blades and gears can be inserted into the edge of the can. 💎Clamp the can with gears and blades, until the blade is cut into the can's lid.💎Hold the handle tightly and rotate the knot in a clockwise direction, keeping the blade piercing and puncturing the lid until the can is totally open.💎Remove the lid to prevent the lid from falling into the food, leave a connection as needed.💎Clean the can opener with a soft towel or running water. Open out fully to make it dry up quickly. Place it in a dry place and keep it dry to rust proof. 🍓Specification ：💎Material: Stainless Steel+TPR💎Size:8.3 x 2.2 x1.7inches💎Color: Black 💎Package:Manual can opener x 1 Free gift=1 beer bottle opener","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6175JAusfqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"webanker","source_asin":"B07XCKS2D3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XCKS2D3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XCKS2D3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
