window.products.push({"id":504146,"name":"DREAMHOUR Pinch Pleated Down Feathers King Size Comforter Aqua All Season Duvet Insert with 100% Cotton Cover,Medium Warm Quilted Bed Comforter with C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zrH76H2IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"King Down Duvet:The King down feathers comforter is measured in 106x90inches.This duvet insert is filled with 25% goose down and 75% goose feathers,which is so fluffy,warm,soft.Fluffy down evenly distributed,tufted quilting,and the cover fabric is high thread count and nicely finished.The DREAMHOUR all season down comforter give you year-round and all night comfort. 100% Cotton Cover:This fabric is very durable,not only very breathable and healthy,but also to prevent the down from running out.Ultra-soft cotton shell feels more soft,breathable and comfortable.There are 8 corner tabs on the comforter shell,so it's easy to wear a duvet cover for the comforter Auqa Pinch Pleated Comforter:The top has tufting on the seams between squares to create a starburst type pattern.This gives it a more elegant appearance if you're using it without a cover.And it helps hold more filling inside the comforter,rendering it more fluffy,like sleeping under a marshmallow.One of a kind aqua,different from the ordinary color.It's a comfortable mild aqua,relaxing your eyes. About Comforter Care:It is recommended to prepare a duvet cover.Washing down bedding products are not recommended.Of course,you can also use it as a stand-alone comforter,this gives it a more elegant appearance if you're using it without a duvet cover.You can pat the duvet or give it a sunshine to keep the comforter fluffy. After receiving the duvet:Our king duvet are Vacuum packaged.Upon receipt,remove this comforter from its packaging,shake out your goose down comforter,fluff gently,and allow several hours for self-recover.Or tumble in the dryer for 15 minutes At low temperature before use.The comforter blooms and the cotton fabric becomes softer with use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zrH76H2IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DREAMHOUR","source_asin":"B0BP6RGZKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6RGZKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6RGZKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
