window.products.push({"id":504226,"name":"Monebena Kids Alarm Clock Cute OK to Wake Alarm Clock for Kids Sleep Training Clock with Night Light and Sleep Sound Machine for Toddlers Boys Girls T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61phuhaSo-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰【Conquer naughty children】-Does your child still don't understand what time is? The cute sleep training clock contains icons and colored lights that will effectively help your toddler know when it's time to get up, play or go to sleep. It will free parents from sleepless nights and allow children to become more independent. ⛅【As You Think】-It' s the beginning of a new day, the sun hidden in the small alarm clock has risen and the lovely alarm clock starts to glow green. At the end of a hard day, the moon in the alarm clock quietly begins to twinkle and glow blue, and it's time for the kids to go to bed. Isn't that interesting? Visual arousal is completely separate from auditory arousal. It helps parents to develop their children's sense of time more freely. 🌛【Funny Night Light】-4 fixed lights and 1 motion light to choose from as a night light. Four levels of lights and time screens are dimmable and the display can be turned off to keep your child from seeing the sun and refusing a nap. The night light can automatically turn off or stay on during the night and the ears of the alarm clock glow so they are fully visible in the dark ...... Adorable! 🎶【Sound Machine】-Dual alarms and snooze modes, 12/24 hour format, 4 levels of adjustable volume. Provides 6 types of wake up sounds. Distinguishable weekday/weekend to avoid your child waking up from a sweet weekend slumber. Meanwhile, the kids alarm clock provides 7 sleep sounds with rhythmic and calm background music to provide better sleep for kids, which can be timed from 0-60 minutes. 💎【One year warranty】-The children's alarm clock spreads out the functions one by one through the body's 10 button settings, making it easy to operate. The support feet and non-slip pads are designed to better place the alarm clock anywhere. It comes with a universal Type-C charging cable and adapter, as well as beautiful packaging and operating instructions to provide you with the best quality service. If you have any questions you can contact us, we will reply you at the first time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61phuhaSo-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monebena","source_asin":"B0BGXJYSL1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGXJYSL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGXJYSL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
