window.products.push({"id":504253,"name":"Adhesive Films High Gloss-Economical Alternative to rehabilitate Your countertops, backsplash and cabinets, (80\"), Black Marble","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Scbp7-yFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Size: 80\" Black Many people are drawn to the look of natural stone materials such as marble when it comes to home decor. While marble may look great and add a certain flair of elegance to your space, it’s not exactly the easiest to work with, or the cheapest. This is especially true when using marble in areas such as a kitchen or bathroom.Fortunately, there are materials such as contact paper and adhesive films that can provide the same look of hard materials such as granite, but at a much cheaper price. They are also much easier to deal with, and can be easily customized and fitted to any type of surface and shape. These materials do present a few problems of their own, however. Sometimes the materials can look unrealistic, wear down easily, or be difficult to apply. All the time you’ve spent planning and applying the adhesive ends up being all for nothing when the final product is achieved, leaving you to start all over again. If you’ve wasted your time and money with overpriced surface adhesives that provide a cheap look, or are simply looking for a reliable, inexpensive way to upgrade your home, we’ve got some great news for you. Versatile and Easy to UseThe film is durable and water resistant, making it perfect for both kitchen and bathroom use. The easy-to-apply nature of the film makes home renovation projects easy and quick, with just a few simple tools and measurements! One afternoon can transform the look of your kitchen or bathroom, and for a fraction of the cost of using real marble. Bathrooms and kitchens aren’t the only place you can use our marble film. Feel free to get creative! The film can be used for providing accents to tables, desks, and any other objects and fixtures in your home that could benefit from an elegant marble look or accent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Scbp7-yFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adhesive Films","source_asin":"B01LXHIGBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXHIGBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXHIGBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
