window.products.push({"id":504504,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld, Drink Mixer Small Handheld milk frother Electric Stick Blender for Latte, Coffee, Cappuccino, and Hot Chocolate, Stainless stee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kmgQWXb-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Treat yourself with a made-at-home latte or cappuccino any morning right in your own kitchen. Save the drive to the coffee shop and get your foamy perfect coffee in the comfort of your own kitchen. Surprise guests or your spouse with your newly found barista skills. The Milk frother packs a powerful punch that can turn ordinary milk into foamy perfection and latte art. It can also work to mix up your bulletproof coffee with butter, MCT oil or other keto drink mixes you decide to make in your mornings or whenever you want to have some fun frothing. Froths Milk and So Much More: hot chocolate, matcha tea, bulletproof coffee, protein powders, chai tea, whipping egg whites, mixing green powders. This milk frother electric also can work with soy, almond or coconut milk and creamers.  The stand is beautiful and many people prefer to leave it out on the counter as decoration because of its sleekness. The whisk cleans in seconds: simply turn on the frother while underwater or inside a glass of hot water to clean. The ergonomic smooth base is not meant to be immersed in water, so keep the cleaning to the whisk. How to use? ★ Take the hot or cold milk in a cup and plunge the frother half way down and power it on.  ★ Just keep moving the frother up and down.  ★ When you have the desired amount of foam, turn off it. Features: Battery Type: AA Battery  Quantity: 2 Battery  Frothing Time: 15-20 Seconds  Power: Battery operated, not included  Perfect Companion to Our Stainless Steel Frothing Pitcher: we focus on product quality and you can count on us to bring you products that we use ourselves in our own kitchens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kmgQWXb-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B088R6C1WZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088R6C1WZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088R6C1WZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
