window.products.push({"id":504595,"name":"Haute Art Designs Decorative DIY Pillow Cover with 12 Paint Tubes and Brush - Enchanted Forest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91l0oJKHeYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shopping for gifts can be difficult, shopping for meaningful gifts is even harder and shopping for somebody who has everything else in their home is virtually impossible. This is why we set out to create unique and meaningful gifts that speak from the heart. All of our stock is made from the finest quality materials and are super conveniently ready-to-gift for any occasion and for everybody on your gift list. Each pillow cover has a sewn in tag printed with: “MADE WITH (red heart) FOR YOU” that you can personalize by hand for your special recipient with your unique message of love, encouragement or inspiration. Allow us to safely take you back to your greatest childhood adventures. Think of it as a type of meditation or effective stress and anxiety buster that can also improve focus and mental clarity. How would it make you feel to unplug from the noise of the world for a little bit of peace, harmony and me time? For Children: Builds: confidence, motor skills, handwriting, concentration, hand-eye coordination, self-expression, color & pattern recognition, art therapy, develop logic & creativity, social play For Adults: Builds: Helps: stress & anxiety, organize thoughts, art therapy, self-expression, meditation, focus & mental clarity, reconnect & rediscover with self, fantasy & imagination, create beautiful artwork for gifts & home décor Haute Art was born from a passion and love for art, creativity and the fusion of style and functionality for home décor. Through our unique pillow covers, our dream is that you create for yourself or present the most personalized gifts possible to your loved ones, friends, teachers and colleagues to express your appreciation for their involvement in your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91l0oJKHeYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haute Art Designs","source_asin":"B01LPG5U9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LPG5U9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LPG5U9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
