window.products.push({"id":504607,"name":"Multicolor Grey MUKUT Print QUEEN Size Kantha Quilt, Kantha Blanket, Bed Cover, QUEEN Kantha bedspread, Ralli Gudri, Bohemian Bedding Kantha Size 90\"x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zB1okbgzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made with 100% cotton and natural vegetable colors. This piece of art is completely hand stitched by Women artisan in Rajasthan, India. It can make any room alive with its vivid colors, stunning Flower ( MUKUT ) print and embroidery, made using traditional and famous kantha hand embroidery method. Made from two thin layer of cotton fabric make this piece of art irresistible and also very comfortable. Adding to it's style, this kantha quilt is reversible and both sides can be used. Kantha is still the most popular form of embroidery practiced by rural women.typically use old saris and cloth and layer them with kantha stitch to make a light blanket, throw or bedspread. These cotton lightweight \"Quilts\" with a beautiful and colorful Flower design can be used as: 1. Bedspread , Bedding Throw , Blanket Or Quilt 2. A Summer Bed Cover 3. A Throw 4. A Fabulous Picnic Rug 5. Nice Bedroom Quilt, This can fit to a 90 x 108 inch's wide Queen size bed as blanket or throw or can easily fit as bedspread / bed cover to King bed . Note: Their might be some negligible size variation of approx 2-3 inches due to handmade, hand washed, hand stitching & performing of Kantha work which is negligible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zB1okbgzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunita Enterprises","source_asin":"B01MT2JHLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT2JHLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT2JHLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
