window.products.push({"id":504653,"name":"Maestoware Tri-Blade Spiral Slicer - Spiralizer Cutter Veggie Pasta Maker Cuts Zucchini & Other Vegetables into Spaghetti, Fettuccine & Julienne Ribbo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ik9-bUZRL._AC_SL1230_.jpg","description":"Pasta is a crowd-pleasing dish the whole family loves, but it's just not that healthy for you. Those starchy noodles are high in calories and short on nutrients, and many processed varieties contain additives and preservatives that you don't want in your diet.  With the Maestoware Tri-Blade Spiral Slicer, you can transform zucchini and other vegetables into yummy, nutritious veggie pasta. The vegetable pasta maker allows you to cut veggies into spaghetti, fettuccine or julienne ribbons with the utmost of ease, so you can replace the noodles in a wide variety of dishes.  Unlike other spiralizers, the Maestoware Tri-Blade Spiral Slicer is incredibly easy to use and built with safety in mind. The unique rounded shape is completely ergonomic to fit firmly in the palm of your hand. Inside, three razor sharp stainless steel blades are built into the spiral cutter, eliminating the need for changing blades to create different cuts. This not only saves time, but it also cuts down on the risk of accidental injuries. Each blade is safely contained inside of the cutter to make the design even safer.  The durable plastic housing of the Maestoware Tri-Blade Spiral Slicer will hold up well to frequent use, and it's completely BPA free to protect your health. Our spiral slicer is even backed by a full satisfaction guarantee, so you can purchase it with confidence.  See how easy it can be to make nutritious veggie pasta for the whole family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ik9-bUZRL._AC_SL1230_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maestoware","source_asin":"B01CA6R4RS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-504653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CA6R4RS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CA6R4RS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
